/* Generated from the game's script packages (property order and
 * types) and its exe (native class sizes). Offsets come from C++ inheritance and bitfield
 * packing, as in UE3's generated headers; every native class's size is asserted. A native
 * class whose script fields don't fill its registered size ends in `_native_tail` (its
 * C++-only members). Field names are UnrealScript's; types are exact where the script says.
 */
